      "comment": "SPECIAL TEAMS (7) was well supported last time but could only manage second (22.94), beaten 2.5 lengths. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Top chance in this line up. PAW BRODY (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 6 lengths at this track (23.12). Goes very well at course and distance boasting two wins. Should be about the money. PAW BALLISTA (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from six tries. Was out of the placings last time (22.91) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 10 lengths. Can feature in the finish. SUPER BATMAN (2) placed last start as favourite and is in the mix again.",
